@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here
@refreshToken = paste-refresh-token-here

### Login USER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/email/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "dat@softaibox.local",
  "password": "java123"
}

### Refresh - API contract giống interceptor của SoftAIBox UI
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Authorization: Bearer {{refreshToken}}

### Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Create conversation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat_conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java interview practice"
}

### List conversations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat_conversations?page=1&limit=10&keyword=java
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Send chat - thay conversation_id bằng id vừa tạo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain dependency injection",
  "conversation_id": 1,
  "modelName": "interview-coach"
}

### Create agent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Daily Java Coach",
  "description": "Creates one interview question every day",
  "task_prompt": "Create a Java junior interview question",
  "schedule_type": "DAILY"
}

### Execute agent - response là 202 Accepted
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/agent/1/executions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin-only endpoint (đăng nhập bằng admin trước)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/demo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

